{"id":"3139477","name":"Patrick Mahomes","team":"KC","pos":"QB","grp":"QB","num":"15","head":"https://a.espncdn.com/i/headshots/nfl/players/full/3139477.png","age":31,"exp":"10","college":"Texas Tech","draft":["2017","1","10"],"depth":{"pos":"QB","rank":1,"unit":"3WR 1TE","team":"KC"},"inj":{"status":"Active","note":"Mahomes was picked off in the second quarter and remarkably recovered his own fumble in a pile of bodies to avoid a second turnover in the third quarter, setting up a Harrison Butker field goal on the next play for the Chiefs' only points of the night. This was the first start in Mahomes' career during which Kansas City failed to reach the red zone, and he hasn't thrown a touchdown pass in two games since KC's Week 5 bye. Seattle's defense dominated while Kansas City struggled to move the ball in the absence of No. 1 WR Rashee Rice (hamstring/knee), whom the Chiefs will hope to get back for a Week 8 road game against the Broncos.","date":"2026-10-26T03:55Z","detail":""},"next":{"opp":"DEN","home":false,"date":"2026-11-01T21:25Z"},"dvp":{"r":14,"td":1.33,"yds":254.0,"n":32,"g":6},"news":[{"h":"Sources: Josh Simmons told to leave Chiefs meeting by Andy Reid, Patrick Mahomes","d":"Josh Simmons was kicked out of a team meeting by Chiefs coach Andy Reid and QB Patrick Mahomes, but the OT later apologized, sources told NFL Network.","t":"2026-10-25T16:21:08Z"},{"h":"Chiefs' Patrick Mahomes earns 100th win in 131st start, tying Tom Brady","d":"Quarterback Patrick Mahomes earned his 100th win with the Chiefs in his 131st regular-season start Sunday, tying Tom Brady for the fewest games needed to reach 100 career wins.","t":"2026-10-19T03:38:02Z"},{"h":"Chiefs move to 5-0 as Kenneth Walker runs for two TDs in a 22-6 win over Chargers","d":"\u2014 Patrick Mahomes hadn't watched the tape of the Chiefs' game against the Los Angeles Chargers from last December \u2014 that game in which he tore ligaments in his left knee and Kansas City was eliminated from postseason